  {
    "source": "Are nodes or subscriptions included?",
    "id": 82
  },
  {
    "source": "No. Serylane is a desktop client, not a proxy service. Bring your own subscription or local Mihomo configuration.",
    "id": 83
  },
  {
    "source": "Will it enable routing or connect Codex automatically?",
    "id": 84
  },
  {
    "source": "No. Domain routing is optional and off by default. Choose tools and an exit, save your draft, then explicitly apply it. New Codex attachment and application-based proxying are currently disabled.",
    "id": 85
  },
  {
    "source": "Read the routing guide",
    "id": 86
  },
  {
    "source": "Is TUN ready on every platform?",
    "id": 87
  },
  {
    "source": "macOS TUN requires a complete Developer ID-signed and Apple-notarized installer. The v0.7.45 release addresses stale helper registrations. Windows TUN is experimental and requires an administrator session; Linux TUN is not implemented. Switching nodes does not resume an interrupted stream.",
